未经作者书面许可，不得：
Without the Author's prior written permission, you may not:

1. 复制、转载、镜像、再分发本软件或其任何部分（含网盘、论坛、应用商店）；
   copy, repost, mirror, or redistribute the Software or any part of it (including cloud drives, forums, or app stores);
2. 修改、反编译、反汇编、逆向工程，或制作衍生作品（法律允许的学习研究除外）；
   modify, decompile, disassemble, reverse engineer, or create derivative works (except study and research permitted by law);
3. 去除、遮挡、篡改版权声明、作者署名、版本标识或许可声明；
   remove, obscure, or alter any copyright notice, attribution, version identifier, or license notice;
4. 改名、换皮后以自己或他人名义发布，或声称系自己原创；
   rebrand or repackage it and publish it under your own or another's name, or claim it as your own work;
5. 用于商业用途，包括销售、捆绑、收费服务、企业内部生产使用；
   use it for commercial purposes, including sale, bundling, paid services, or internal productive use by an organization;
6. 用于训练机器学习模型、构建竞争性产品或自动生成同类工具。
   use it to train machine learning models, build a competing product, or automatically generate similar tools.

